sequenceDiagram
    %% Phase 5.5 — baseline diff: candidate vs golden/good run.
    %% No re-execution; reads stored verdicts and joins on scenario_name.
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator / UI
    participant Api as FastAPI eval_api
    participant Store as TraceStore
    participant Candidate as candidate eval_runs row
    participant Baseline as baseline eval_runs row

    Note over Op,Baseline: Earlier: candidate run was submitted via POST /api/v1/evals<br/>+ baseline run persisted previously
    Op->>Api: GET /api/v1/evals/{candidate_id}/baseline<br/>?baseline_run_id={baseline_id}
    Api->>Api: _is_valid_uuid both params<br/>else HTTP 400

    Api->>Store: get_eval_run(candidate_id)
    Store->>Candidate: SELECT * FROM eval_runs<br/>+ scenarios ORDER BY seq
    Candidate-->>Store: EvalSuiteResult
    Store-->>Api: candidate_result

    alt candidate missing
        Api-->>Op: HTTP 404 not found
    end

    Api->>Store: get_eval_run(baseline_id)
    Store->>Baseline: SELECT * FROM eval_runs<br/>+ scenarios ORDER BY seq
    Baseline-->>Store: EvalSuiteResult
    Store-->>Api: baseline_result

    alt baseline missing
        Api-->>Op: HTTP 404 not found
    end

    Api->>Api: _build_baseline_diff(baseline, candidate)
    Note over Api: index baseline.scenarios by name<br/>for each candidate scenario:<br/>changed = (v_cand != v_base)<br/>copy detail strings per side
    Api-->>Op: EvalBaselineDiffView JSON<br/>{ baseline_run_id, candidate_run_id,<br/>overall_changed, scenarios[] }

    Note over Op: EvalRunDetail.tsx renders Δ marker<br/>on every changed row + summary banner
